second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the song \\\"It's Raining\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"It's Raining (Irma Thomas song) \\\"It's Raining\\\" is a soul/R&B ballad, credited as written by Naomi Neville.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"start\": 107, \"end\": 194, \"text\": \"It was first recorded in November 1961 by Irma Thomas, and produced by Allen Toussaint.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"start\": 195, \"end\": 400, \"text\": \"The song has emotional ties to Louisiana, having been written and sung by people born in that State, being released on a New Orleans–based record label and enduring in the Deep South as a regional classic.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"start\": 401, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"\\\"It's Raining\\\", alongside \\\"Ruler of My Heart\\\" and \\\"I Done Got Over It\\\", remain some of Thomas' best–known recordings.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 593, \"text\": \"Initially Thomas recorded for Ron Records but, in 1961, she left for Minit\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 4, \"text\": \"'' .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 5, \"end\": 15, \"text\": \"AllMusic .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 16, \"end\": 43, \"text\": \"Retrieved August 5 , 2017 .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 44, \"end\": 103, \"text\": \"^ a b c `` IRMA THOMAS - The Soul Queen of New Orleans '' .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 104, \"end\": 117, \"text\": \"Helsinki.fi .\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 118, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"Retrieved August 5 , 2017 .\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 229, \"text\": \"^ `` Singer Irma Thomas : New Orleans ' soul queen still strong after 60 years '' .\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 230, \"end\": 240, \"text\": \"Scpr.com .\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 241, \"end\": 257, \"text\": \"July 19 , 2016 .\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 258, \"end\": 285, \"text\": \"Retrieved August 5 , 2017 .\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 286, \"end\": 339, \"text\": \"^ `` Irma Thomas : The Soul Queen Of New Orleans '' .\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 340, \"end\": 349, \"text\": \"Npr.org .\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 350, \"end\": 377, \"text\": \"Retrieved August 5 , 2017 .\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 378, \"end\": 399, \"text\": \"^ Roberts , Randall .\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01\", \"start\": 400, \"end\": 462, \"text\": \"`` Ten classic interpretations of Allen Toussaint 's greatness\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 137, \"text\": \"It's Raining (Rain song) \\\"It's Raining\\\" is a Korean language song, and the first single from the third album, by Korean R&B singer, Rain.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 138, \"end\": 271, \"text\": \"\\\"It's Raining\\\" first hit airwaves in September 2004 (a month before the album, \\\"It's Raining\\\"), and was met with a positive response.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 272, \"end\": 339, \"text\": \"The single went straight to the number one position in South Korea.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 340, \"end\": 430, \"text\": \"The single and its album launched Rain as an international artist throughout Asia in 2005.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 431, \"end\": 542, \"text\": \"Both reached number one in several places, including Vietnam, Taiwan, Thailand, China, Shanghai, and Hong Kong.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"start\": 543, \"end\": 606, \"text\": \"With this single, Rain presented a brand-new image to his fans,\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 75, \"text\": \"song was met with commercial success , and topped various domestic charts .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d03\", \"start\": 76, \"end\": 219, \"text\": \"It won the Most Popular Music Video daesang award at the 2004 Mnet Km Music Video Festival and the Grand Prize at the annual KBS Music Awards .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d03\", \"start\": 220, \"end\": 564, \"text\": \"Contents 1 Background and composition 2 Reception and impact 3 Accolades 4 Music video and live performances 5 Credits and personnel 6 Release history 7 References 8 External links Background and composition edit In an attempt to attract a larger international audience , he changed his name from Bi ( meaning 'rain ' in Korean ) to its English\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Irma Thomas\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the song \\\"It's Raining\\\"\", \"claim\": \"The song \\\"It's Raining\\\" was first recorded in November 1961 by Irma Thomas.\", \"answer\": \"Irma Thomas\", \"quote\": \"It was first recorded in November 1961 by Irma Thomas, and produced by Allen Toussaint.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Rain\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the song \\\"It's Raining\\\"\", \"claim\": \"It's Raining is a song by Korean R&B singer Rain.\", \"answer\": \"Rain\", \"quote\": \"It's Raining (Rain song) \\\"It's Raining\\\" is a Korean language song, and the first single from the third album, by Korean R&B singer, Rain.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Irma Thomas\", \"Rain\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Irma Thomas\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Rain\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
